WEBVTT

00:00:00.408 --> 00:00:08.489
In this video, you will record a local business that paid you to sponsor your contest, so its name and logo are thanked on your contest page.

00:00:08.489 --> 00:00:09.582
We start on the map.

00:00:10.429 --> 00:00:12.190
Start at SoCal Lights dot app.

00:00:14.969 --> 00:00:17.516
On the home page, tap Use my location.

00:00:19.172 --> 00:00:20.152
Then tap Allow.

00:00:23.516 --> 00:00:26.724
Now look at the top of the map, beside the search box.

00:00:26.724 --> 00:00:29.506
See your picture, or your initial, in a circle?

00:00:29.506 --> 00:00:34.069
That is your account menu, and it is the doorway to everything else on the site.

00:00:34.069 --> 00:00:34.771
Tap it.

00:00:37.287 --> 00:00:39.246
In the menu, tap Your contests.

00:00:41.830 --> 00:00:45.921
That is where the contests you run, and the homes you entered, live.

00:00:45.921 --> 00:00:46.778
Tap Mine.

00:00:48.561 --> 00:00:50.531
This is your personal page.

00:00:50.531 --> 00:00:56.005
It lists the contests you run, if you run any, and the homes you entered, with their status.

00:00:56.005 --> 00:00:58.114
Tap Manage, next to your contest.

00:00:59.844 --> 00:01:03.942
This opens your dashboard, the control room for your contest.

00:01:03.942 --> 00:01:07.431
A sponsor is a local business that supports your contest.

00:01:07.431 --> 00:01:09.558
This tab is where you record one.

00:01:09.558 --> 00:01:10.616
Tap Sponsors.

00:01:12.273 --> 00:01:13.956
Type the company's name.

00:01:13.956 --> 00:01:16.879
The Level is already set, and you can change it.

00:01:16.879 --> 00:01:23.173
Then choose their logo, a J P G, P N G, or WebP file under six hundred kilobytes.

00:01:24.928 --> 00:01:27.018
Now how the sponsorship counts.

00:01:27.018 --> 00:01:29.818
The sponsor paid you yourself, so choose Paid to me.

00:01:30.672 --> 00:01:34.702
Tick that you collected the payment, and add the date and how it was paid.

00:01:34.702 --> 00:01:37.226
Sponsors pay you, never SoCal Lights.

00:01:38.257 --> 00:01:42.448
Tick that you have the sponsor's permission, and tick Show on the contest page.

00:01:43.742 --> 00:01:44.963
Tap Save sponsor.

00:01:46.800 --> 00:01:48.650
Payment never affects who wins.

00:01:49.501 --> 00:01:57.559
To check how it looks, open More, then tap See it as voters do, and you will see the sponsor on the contest page, just as your neighbors do.

00:01:59.443 --> 00:02:02.074
Next up: Invite a sponsor to your contest.
